OL,3,AAt least 64 killed in Spanish
OL,4,Ahigh-speed train crash with dozens
OL,5,Aseriously injured, regional government
OL,6,Asays
OL,7,
OL,8,FAt least 64 people have been killed,
OL,9,Fofficials say, after a Spanish
OL,10,Fhigh-speed train collided with another
OL,11,Ftrain south of the capital Madrid
OL,13,FThe updated death toll makes the rail
OL,14,Fdisaster the country's worst since
OL,15,F2013, when 80 people died after a train
OL,16,Fderailed in north-western Spain
OL,18,FMore than 500 passengers were
OL,19,Ftravelling on the trains involved in
OL,20,Ftoday's collision, the spokesperson for
OL,21,Fthe regional government says
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
