OL,3,AAt least 64 killed in Spanish
OL,4,Ahigh-speed train crash with dozens
OL,5,Aseriously injured, regional government
OL,6,Asays
OL,7,
OL,8,FSpain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,9,Fsays he is "shocked by the serious
OL,10,Ftrain accident" and is in constant
OL,11,Fcontact with the transport minister
OL,13,FRail operator Adif says the incident
OL,14,Foccurred between a Renfe train and
OL,15,Fanother of the Iryo company, which
OL,16,Fcovers the Madrid to Seville route
